        "description": "STEP 10a — MUST CALL THIS BEFORE REQUEST 10.\nReturns content_hash and workflow_version\nspecifically for POD Capture API.\nThese are DIFFERENT from Job Detail hash.\nPOD Capture hash = shipment.updated_at ISO string.\nJob Detail hash = full fingerprint digest.\nDo NOT mix them up.\npod_content_hash and pod_workflow_version are\nsaved automatically for use in Request 10."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
